WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:03.602
"What's Jack doing here?" Roxy thought.

2
00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:06.141
Jack walked up to Spike.

3
00:00:06.142 --> 00:00:10.438
He wore an amulet around his neck.

4
00:00:10.439 --> 00:00:13.770
So did all the other kids, Roxy realized.

5
00:00:13.771 --> 00:00:17.145
"Ahem." Roxy cleared her throat loudly.

6
00:00:17.146 --> 00:00:18.947
But Jack didn't look at her.

7
00:00:18.948 --> 00:00:25.678
Instead he bowed to Spike and started showing off some karate skills.

8
00:00:25.679 --> 00:00:28.455
"Something is wrong," Roxy thought.

9
00:00:28.456 --> 00:00:31.227
"Jack is brainwashed too!"

10
00:00:31.228 --> 00:00:33.259
"Good job!" Spike said.

11
00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:38.023
"I'm sure Rocket Girl is very impressed." He turned to Roxy.

12
00:00:38.024 --> 00:00:41.881
"Thank you for coming. I hope you find your thieves."

13
00:00:41.882 --> 00:00:47.500
"I, er, changed my mind about a lesson," Roxy said quickly.

14
00:00:47.501 --> 00:00:52.886
"I want to learn karate from you too." She bowed to the sensei.

15
00:00:52.887 --> 00:00:55.841
"Wonderful!" Spike's face lit up.

16
00:00:55.842 --> 00:00:59.126
"You will become my most powerful student!

17
00:00:59.127 --> 00:01:02.761
And then my studio will be unstoppable.

18
00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:05.877
Put this on." He held out an amulet.

19
00:01:05.878 --> 00:01:08.763
Roxy used her x-ray vision to see inside.

20
00:01:08.764 --> 00:01:13.532
She saw gears and wires. The sensei's amulet had them too.

21
00:01:13.533 --> 00:01:18.125
"He's using the amulets to control everyone!" Roxy thought.

22
00:01:18.126 --> 00:01:21.468
As she took the amulet, the sensei's phone rang.

23
00:01:21.469 --> 00:01:25.547
"Hello?" He stepped away to take the call.

24
00:01:25.548 --> 00:01:27.949
"Good," Spike said into the phone.

25
00:01:27.950 --> 00:01:32.669
"Meet me behind the studio right now. And don't forget the money or . . ."

26
00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:37.505
While Spike wasn't looking, Roxy broke the amulet.

27
00:01:37.506 --> 00:01:40.675
Then she threw the broken pieces in a bamboo plant.

28
00:01:40.676 --> 00:01:47.705
A second later Spike finished his call.

29
00:01:47.706 --> 00:01:50.146
He hurried toward a back door.

30
00:01:50.147 --> 00:01:54.332
The students followed him and so did Roxy.

31
00:01:54.333 --> 00:01:58.027
"Spike has to think he's controlling me," she thought.

32
00:01:58.028 --> 00:02:00.989
She stared straight ahead like the other kids.

33
00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:05.272
A moving truck pulled up.

34
00:02:05.273 --> 00:02:09.347
The driver hopped out and opened the back.

35
00:02:09.348 --> 00:02:15.567
A student loaded a crate onto the truck.

36
00:02:15.568 --> 00:02:20.067
"Whoa!" Roxy thought, using her x-ray vision to see inside.

37
00:02:20.068 --> 00:02:22.847
"The Jade Dragon vase!"

38
00:02:22.848 --> 00:02:26.500
The driver handed a bag to Spike. "Here's your payment."

39
00:02:26.501 --> 00:02:30.304
Spike grinned. "This will make me rich!

40
00:02:30.305 --> 00:02:34.401
Next I'll send Rocket Girl to rob every bank in Metro City!"

41
00:02:34.402 --> 00:02:40.533
"Nobody is stealing anything for you anymore!" Roxy stepped forward.

42
00:02:40.534 --> 00:02:45.153
Spike frowned. "Why isn't your amulet working, Rocket Girl?

43
00:02:45.154 --> 00:02:48.135
No matter. Students, attack!"

44
00:02:48.136 --> 00:02:51.584
Roxy was suddenly surrounded by karate students.

45
00:02:51.585 --> 00:02:54.509
One came at her with a kick. She ducked.

46
00:02:54.510 --> 00:02:56.564
Another kid used a karate chop.

47
00:02:56.565 --> 00:02:59.918
Roxy blocked the blow—and then froze.

48
00:02:59.919 --> 00:03:03.812
"Uh-oh. I can't fight kids," Roxy thought.

49
00:03:03.813 --> 00:03:06.053
"What if I hurt somebody?"

50
00:03:06.054 --> 00:03:09.694
"Ai-ya!" Just then Jack started running toward Roxy.

51
00:03:09.695 --> 00:03:16.046
He jumped in the air, coming at her with a spinning kick!

